  "source": "Hand-curated station names: the English name as signed on the platform, its Devanagari form, and Roman/Devanagari aliases. A station the RTA renames keeps its old name as an alias. Applied to the RTA feed by location (packages/content-tools/src/publishTransport.ts): a feed stop of the same mode within 300 m takes this name, and a bus bay is pinned by the feed's own stop id. Every location here comes from the feed itself, not from a map by hand — a coordinate that is out by a few hundred metres works until the day a name changes, and then it is the only thing left.",
